{"id":8849592,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/3910","number":3910,"state":"merged","title":"修复tensor_equal某些场景下判断失效问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3910","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3910/issues","body":"## 描述\n修复tensor_equal在非int8的整型比较场景下的比较结果异常问题 & 修改算子图原型定义中将DT_INT16误写为DT_IN16的问题(关联issue https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2197)\n## 根因分析\ntensor_equal算子在整型模板下，会将其转化为uint8_t粒度进行比较，原有代码在CopyIn搬运数据过程中，对于GM offset的计算未同步调整，导致当整型长度大于8时，尾部元素无法参与比较，进而出现精度问题\n\n## 变更内容\n1. 修改 算子图原型定义的笔误，将DT_IN16改为DT_INT16\n2. 在CopyIN取数过程中，纠正offset的计算，将offset 先乘 (SIZEOF(T) / SIZEOF(InputType))后再取数\n\n## 测试\nST、冒烟测试通过\n\n## 文档更新\n不涉及\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":11,"assignees":[{"id":"6822d21660184036954b1468","login":"wangrui_","name":"RuiWang_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangrui_","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e470543b5b4023533df4","login":"jia0liang","name":"陈佳良","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jia0liang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng","assignee":true,